.TH GWAY-KIOSK-STATUS 1 "2026-08-08" "GWAY local tools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
gway-kiosk-status \- serve the local GWAY AP, card, system, and TODO kiosk page
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gway-kiosk-status
[\fB--host\fR ADDRESS]
[\fB--port\fR PORT]
[\fB--json\fR]
[\fB--self-test\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B gway-kiosk-status
serves a loopback-only kiosk dashboard for this host. The page reads local AP
credentials, RFID scanner state, LCD history, system warnings, service health,
and the host-local TODO queue without requiring Arthexis source routes or
templates.
.PP
The installed system service listens on
.BR http://127.0.0.1:8899/ .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --host ADDRESS
Bind address. The default is 127.0.0.1.
.TP
.B --port PORT
Bind port. The default is 8899.
.TP
.B --json
Print one kiosk JSON payload and exit.
.TP
.B --self-test
Build one page, validate key sections, and exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B GWAY_KIOSK_TODO_FILE
TODO file to display. Defaults to /home/arthe/TODO.txt.
.TP
.B GWAY_KIOSK_WORKGROUP_FILE
Active work status file. Defaults to /home/arthe/workgroup.txt.
.TP
.B GWAY_KIOSK_WORK_ACTIVE_MAX_AGE_MINUTES
Maximum workgroup entry age considered active. Defaults to 360.
.TP
.B GWAY_KIOSK_REFRESH_SECONDS
Browser refresh polling interval. Defaults to 30.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /home/arthe/TODO.txt
Host-local TODO queue.
.TP
.I /home/arthe/workgroup.txt
Host-local active work marker.
.TP
.I /home/arthe/ap-password.txt
Host-local AP credentials.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR todo.sh (1),
.BR systemctl (1)
